{
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "notes": "Every palette maps to the same 7 roles so the renderer never guesses. Corrections to source: 'Seafoam Green #778BEB' was actually periwinkle (renamed); 'Fern' key had a stray quote. Added palettes required by style families: bauhaus-primary, brutal-pop, memphis-pastel, deco-gold. 'contrast' lists text/bg pairs that pass WCAG AA (≥4.5:1) — renderer must only use listed pairs for body text. text and textMuted pass AA on both bg and surface in every palette; primary and accent are fill colours only, never text on bg. v1.0.1 contrast fixes: retro-sorbet Pale Iris #786FA6→#60578D; bauhaus-primary Signal Red #D7263D→#D0253B; midnight-gala textMuted #9A7B56→#B59A7B; technical-slate textMuted #8892B0→#949DB8.",
